    "_postman_id": "9b983ed7-3108-4052-bfa5-8eafba6db5cc",
    "name": "FXRates Convert Latest Rates API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "FXRatesAPI is a foreign exchange rates REST API serving real-time and historical currency exchange rates for 185+ fiat currencies plus major cryptocurrencies and precious metals. All endpoints return JSON over HTTPS from the base host https://api.fxratesapi.com. A limited tier is usable without an API key; a paid API key (passed as the api_key query parameter or an Authorization Bearer header) raises quotas, increases update frequency, and unlocks base-currency switching.\n\nEndpoint paths, methods, and parameters below are grounded in live probes of the API on 2026-07-12. Response schemas are modeled from the observed JSON payloads rather than a provider-published machine-readable schema, and only parameters confirmed during probing are asserted; additional optional parameters may exist.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: FXRatesAPI",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
  }
